      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 107,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 107,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "manager.py  --  run_round()  (절차형 코드)\n\n태스크마다:\n1) reputation.directed_winner(task_id) 확인\n   있으면: 공고/입찰 생략, 바로 award\n   (message 1개만 증가)\n2) collect_bids(team, task) -- 공고 방송\n3) award(bids, reputation) --\n   confidence x reputation.score() 로 가중치\n4) reputation.record(winner, correct?, task_id)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 225,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "manager.py  --  run_round()  (절차형 코드)\n\n태스크마다:\n1) reputation.directed_winner(task_id) 확인\n   있으면: 공고/입찰 생략, 바로 award\n   (message 1개만 증가)\n2) collect_bids(team, task) -- 공고 방송\n3) award(bids, reputation) --\n   confidence x reputation.score() 로 가중치\n4) reputation.record(winner, correct?, task_id)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
